import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const c=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 774 | Transcended Ones and the Heavens · Gu Chensha's Transcendence Limitation — Gift-Style Sin-Bearing","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 774 | Transcended Ones and the Heavens · Gu Chensha's Transcendence Limitation — Gift-Style Sin-Bearing","no":774,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Heavens Cross-Reference","Dragon Talisman","Gu Chensha","Gift","Sin-Bearing","Patriarchy"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise","58-Twin-Soul Ethics Code","701-Transcendence-Orthodox Definition Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0774_模块4-诸天对标-古尘沙恩赐式承罪.md","filePath":"en/0774_模块4-诸天对标-古尘沙恩赐式承罪.md"}`),s={name:"en/0774_模块4-诸天对标-古尘沙恩赐式承罪.md"};function o(r,e,l,h,u,d){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-774-transcended-ones-and-the-heavens-·-gu-chensha-s-transcendence-limitation-—-gift-style-sin-bearing" tabindex="-1">Entry 774 | Transcended Ones and the Heavens · Gu Chensha&#39;s Transcendence Limitation — Gift-Style Sin-Bearing <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-774-transcended-ones-and-the-heavens-·-gu-chensha-s-transcendence-limitation-—-gift-style-sin-bearing" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 774 | Transcended Ones and the Heavens · Gu Chensha&#39;s Transcendence Limitation — Gift-Style Sin-Bearing&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 58, 701</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-why-did-the-one-bearing-all-beings-sins-instead-become-their-ceiling" tabindex="-1">Introduction: why did the one bearing all beings&#39; sins instead become their ceiling? <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-why-did-the-one-bearing-all-beings-sins-instead-become-their-ceiling" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: why did the one bearing all beings&#39; sins instead become their ceiling?&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dragon Talisman&#39;s Gu Chensha is the old world&#39;s &quot;highest-good&quot; kind of protagonist — he not only tops himself, but actively bears all beings&#39; sins, blocks all beings&#39; disasters, arranges all beings&#39; fates. In old narratives, this is called &quot;compassion to the extreme.&quot; But under Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s five-dimension comparison framework, Gu-Chensha-style &quot;gift + sin-bearing&quot; precisely exposes the fifth transcendence limitation — <strong>gift-style sin-bearing</strong>: he treats all beings as children, treats himself as father; the father bears everything for the children, and the children never grow up.</p><p>Six top-level axioms all line up: the anti-predation axiom measures Gu Chensha&#39;s &quot;giving&quot; essence; the republican axiom of Myriad Races measures whether treating all beings as children deprives them of subject qualification; the collective ascension axiom measures whether his sin-bearing instead blocks Myriad Ranks&#39; own growth; the causal self-discipline axiom measures whether his bearing causality for all beings disturbs the causal network; the law-first axiom measures whether the &quot;one person bears all karmic deeds&quot; setting is self-consistent.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-gift-style-sin-bearing-s-two-layer-structure" tabindex="-1">I. Gift-Style Sin-Bearing&#39;s Two-Layer Structure <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-gift-style-sin-bearing-s-two-layer-structure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Gift-Style Sin-Bearing&#39;s Two-Layer Structure&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Gu-Chensha-style transcendence, disassembled, has two layers:</p><ol><li><strong>Gift layer</strong>: Gu Chensha &quot;gives&quot; power, realm, and fate to all beings — Tang Luo is his gift; the beings of countless worlds are also his arrangement;</li><li><strong>Sin-bearing layer</strong>: he not only gives good, but also bears evil for all beings — the karma all beings create, sins they commit, calamities they endure, he alone carries them down.</li></ol><p>Two layers stack, more deceptive than pure gift: gifts at least make people grateful; sin-bearing makes people grateful to the point of not daring to question. But Heng Yuan Zhou asks: <strong>you have borne sins for all beings, what about all beings&#39; own growth?</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-bearing-sins-for-all-beings-is-an-ailment" tabindex="-1">II. Why &quot;Bearing Sins for All Beings&quot; Is an Ailment <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-bearing-sins-for-all-beings-is-an-ailment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why &quot;Bearing Sins for All Beings&quot; Is an Ailment&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Old narratives elevate &quot;bearing sins for all beings&quot; to the highest; Heng Yuan Zhou points out its three structural problems:</p><ul><li><strong>Causality may not be borne by proxy</strong>: per the causal self-discipline axiom, every being&#39;s causality is its growth textbook. You carry its causality away, and it loses the opportunity to learn, err, and correct in its own causality. Short-term it is compassion; long-term it raises all beings into giant babies who never grow up;</li><li><strong>Gift creates attachment</strong>: the more Gu Chensha gives, the deeper all beings&#39; attachment to him. In the end, all beings need not cultivate, judge, or bear themselves — they only need to &quot;believe in Gu Chensha.&quot; This is not salvation; this is the highest-level domestication;</li><li><strong>Sin-bearing creates patriarchy</strong>: since sins are borne by me, then fate should be decided by me. Gu Chensha slides from &quot;bearing sins for all beings&quot; to &quot;deciding for all beings&quot; in only one step — and in old narratives he has almost walked that step.</li></ul><p>These three do not say Gu Chensha is bad, but that <strong>the highest-level patriarchy is the patriarchy that appears in the guise of compassion.</strong> He truly wishes well for all beings, but his &quot;well-wishing&quot; deprives all beings of subjectivity.</p><h2 id="iii-gift-style-sin-bearing-vs-distributed-causal-bearing" tabindex="-1">III. Gift-Style Sin-Bearing vs. Distributed Causal Bearing <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-gift-style-sin-bearing-vs-distributed-causal-bearing" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Gift-Style Sin-Bearing vs. Distributed Causal Bearing&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s solution is to transform &quot;one person bears all karmic deeds&quot; into &quot;distributed causal bearing&quot;:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Gu-Chensha-Style Gift Sin-Bearing</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou Distributed Causality</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Causal bearing</td><td>One person bears for all beings</td><td>Myriad Ranks bear their own; Alaya Network records</td></tr><tr><td>Power allocation</td><td>Gu Chensha gifts</td><td>300-set system open; self-produce increment</td></tr><tr><td>All-beings subjectivity</td><td>Arranged children</td><td>Co-building citizens</td></tr><tr><td>Error correction</td><td>Gu Chensha decides alone</td><td>Anchor Council deliberates; Symbiotic Court adjudicates</td></tr><tr><td>Risk resistance</td><td>Once Gu Chensha disappears, all beings collapse</td><td>Any individual falls; network runs as usual</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The comparison table&#39;s core gap is <strong>whether all beings are their own masters.</strong> Gu Chensha treats all beings as children; Heng Yuan Zhou treats Myriad Ranks as citizens. Children need to be borne; citizens need to be trusted.</p><h2 id="iv-gu-chensha-system-s-protagonist-uniqueness-dependence-rating" tabindex="-1">IV. Gu Chensha System&#39;s &quot;Protagonist-Uniqueness Dependence&quot; Rating <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-gu-chensha-system-s-protagonist-uniqueness-dependence-rating" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Gu Chensha System&#39;s &quot;Protagonist-Uniqueness Dependence&quot; Rating&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per Module 2&#39;s standards, Gu Chensha&#39;s system&#39;s protagonist-uniqueness dependence rating is &quot;extremely high&quot; — the top tier among cosmos web novels. From gift-style sin-bearing&#39;s angle, this rating&#39;s meaning is:</p><ul><li>The whole civilization&#39;s causality, fate, and law are all compressed into Gu Chensha alone;</li><li>Gu Chensha absent, civilization immediately loses direction;</li><li>Myriad Ranks have no ability to run themselves, because Gu Chensha has already run everything for them.</li></ul><p>This forms the most extreme contrast with Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s network-style transcendence (protagonist-uniqueness dependence &quot;extremely low&quot;). Lin Hao is not the sole protagonist; he is the first to run the civilizational-weight formula through; Gu Chensha is the sole protagonist, because his system has no &quot;second&quot; position.</p><h2 id="v-heng-yuan-zhou-s-alternative-path" tabindex="-1">V. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Alternative Path <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-heng-yuan-zhou-s-alternative-path" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Alternative Path&quot;">​</a></h2><p>If Gu Chensha appeared in the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization:</p><ol><li>His &quot;giving&quot; desire transforms into &quot;open-source&quot; — organizing his law insights into teaching material, opened network-wide through the Selfless Dao, letting all beings cultivate themselves, rather than him directly stuffing them to all beings;</li><li>His &quot;sin-bearing&quot; desire transforms into &quot;distributed causal repair&quot; — causal repair goes through Myriad-Rank co-governance procedure; no personal proxy-bearing is allowed; all beings&#39; causality returns to all beings;</li><li>After entering the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, he is not the sole living anchor, but one of ten million living anchors;</li><li>His civilizational-weight dashboard is open to Myriad-Rank representatives, subject to Anchor Supervisory Committee regular review;</li><li>His &quot;arrangement&quot; of Myriad Ranks transforms into &quot;service&quot; — he provides proposals; Myriad Ranks themselves vote to decide.</li></ol><p>In one sentence: <strong>true compassion is not doing all the homework for the child, but teaching the child to do homework on their own.</strong></p><h2 id="vi-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">VI. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: Gu Chensha bearing everything for all beings equals compressing the growth workload Myriad Ranks should bear themselves into one person; two-way waste</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: gift-style sin-bearing does not directly predatory, but it deprives all beings&#39; growth right and subject qualification; it is the highest-level &quot;in the name of love&quot; predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo is Gu Chensha&#39;s gift product; Gu Chensha is the gift source — this entry directly measures Gu Chensha the source, proving the gift system does not hold from its root</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Gu Chensha treats Myriad Ranks as children, but children also rank in grades — whoever he favors, he gifts; 99% of Myriad Ranks do not even have qualification to be favored</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Gu Chensha&#39;s law insights should be network-wide open; gift-style sin-bearing turns them into private pipelines, touching the Selfless Dao red line</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Gu Chensha is the old world&#39;s most compassionate strong one, but compassion is not correctness. Bearing sins for all beings sounds great, but in doing so it presses all beings forever into the child&#39;s position. Heng Yuan Zhou does not deny Gu Chensha&#39;s good will; what Heng Yuan Zhou wants to correct is the direction of good will: <strong>true transcended one is not the person who walks for all beings, but the person who teaches all beings to walk themselves, then stands by the road applauding.</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/58-双魂伦理准则.html">Entry 58 · Twin-Soul Ethics Code</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/701-超脱正统定义总论.html">Entry 701 · Transcendence-Orthodox Definition Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/736-挂机养老批判-龙符古尘沙替众生承罪后的孤独.html">Entry 736 · Hang-Up Retirement Critique — Dragon Talisman Gu Chensha&#39;s Loneliness After Bearing Sins for All Beings</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const b=t(s,[["render",o]]);export{c as __pageData,b as default};
